{"title":"Career roadmap — Company Secretary Trainee","role":"Company Secretary Trainee","summary":"A Company Secretary Trainee supports corporate governance, company-law compliance, statutory filings, board and shareholder meetings, corporate records, and regulatory documentation. In India, the professional Company Secretary (CS) qualification is regulated by the Institute of Company Secretaries of India (ICSI), so B.Com alone does not make someone a qualified Company Secretary.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Corporate Secretaryship"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Corporate Secretaryship","CS qualification","Practical Training","Company Secretary","Governance/Compliance Specialist"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What to focus on"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Company law, corporate governance, ROC/MCA filings, secretarial practice, drafting and documentation"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Listed-company compliance, SEBI regulations, board governance, corporate restructuring"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Governance advisory, compliance technology, ESG governance, risk and regulatory strategy"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"AI-enabled compliance, digital governance, board advisory, regulatory technology and governance leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Commerce + corporate-law foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Business economics"},{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Business law"},{"text":"Company fundamentals"},{"text":"Corporate structures"},{"text":"Partnership vs company"},{"text":"Private vs public company"},{"text":"Share capital"},{"text":"Directors"},{"text":"Members/shareholders"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn basic legal terminology:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Memorandum of Association"},{"text":"Articles of Association"},{"text":"Board Resolution"},{"text":"Special Resolution"},{"text":"Ordinary Resolution"},{"text":"Minutes"},{"text":"Statutory registers"},{"text":"Corporate records"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Professional writing"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Word/document formatting"},{"text":"Business correspondence"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Company law + secretarial practice"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"h","text":"Companies Act concepts"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Incorporation"},{"text":"Share capital"},{"text":"Directors"},{"text":"Board meetings"},{"text":"General meetings"},{"text":"Shareholders"},{"text":"Dividends"},{"text":"Related-party transactions"},{"text":"Charges"},{"text":"Loans and investments"},{"text":"Corporate restructuring"},{"text":"Winding-up concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Secretarial work"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Notice drafting"},{"text":"Agenda preparation"},{"text":"Board minutes"},{"text":"General meeting minutes"},{"text":"Resolutions"},{"text":"Registers"},{"text":"Compliance calendars"},{"text":"Statutory filings"},{"text":"Corporate documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the role of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MCA"},{"text":"ROC"},{"text":"SEBI"},{"text":"Stock exchanges"},{"text":"RBI"},{"text":"NCLT"}]},{"type":"p","text":"where relevant to the company and transaction."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Professional CS specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate governance"},{"text":"Securities laws"},{"text":"SEBI regulations"},{"text":"Listing obligations"},{"text":"Insider trading compliance"},{"text":"Takeovers"},{"text":"Corporate restructuring"},{"text":"Mergers and acquisitions"},{"text":"Due diligence"},{"text":"Secretarial audit concepts"},{"text":"Corporate social responsibility"},{"text":"ESG governance"},{"text":"Risk and compliance"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn practical systems:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MCA portal workflows"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Digital documentation"},{"text":"Compliance trackers"},{"text":"Basic legal research"},{"text":"Regulatory databases"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final year — Professional practice portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Corporate Compliance Calendar"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a simulated compliance calendar for a company."},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Compliance","Applicable Law","Due Date","Responsible Person","Filing","Status","Evidence"]},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Board meetings"},{"text":"Annual general meeting"},{"text":"Annual filings"},{"text":"Director-related filings"},{"text":"Share-related filings"},{"text":"Event-based compliance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Board Meeting Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Board meeting notice"},{"text":"Agenda"},{"text":"Board papers"},{"text":"Draft resolutions"},{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"Minutes"},{"text":"Action tracker"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates actual secretarial workflow."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Corporate Governance Review"},{"type":"p","text":"Take a listed company and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Board composition"},{"text":"Independent directors"},{"text":"Board committees"},{"text":"Related-party transactions"},{"text":"Shareholding pattern"},{"text":"Corporate governance disclosures"},{"text":"Annual report disclosures"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare a professional governance report."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Key skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Corporate Compliance"},{"text":"Companies Act, MCA/ROC"}],[{"text":"Listed Company Compliance"},{"text":"SEBI, listing regulations"}],[{"text":"Corporate Governance"},{"text":"Board and shareholder governance"}],[{"text":"Secretarial Audit"},{"text":"Compliance verification"}],[{"text":"Corporate Restructuring"},{"text":"M&A, mergers, schemes"}],[{"text":"Securities Law"},{"text":"Capital markets and SEBI"}],[{"text":"Legal Compliance"},{"text":"Regulatory research"}],[{"text":"ESG Governance"},{"text":"Sustainability + governance"}],[{"text":"Corporate Legal"},{"text":"Contracts + company law"}],[{"text":"Compliance Technology"},{"text":"RegTech, automation, data"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships / practical training","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Practising Company Secretaries"},{"text":"Secretarial audit firms"},{"text":"Corporate legal departments"},{"text":"Listed companies"},{"text":"Public companies"},{"text":"Private companies"},{"text":"Banks"},{"text":"Financial institutions"},{"text":"Investment companies"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Legal and compliance teams"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship roles"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Company Secretary Intern"},{"text":"CS Trainee"},{"text":"Secretarial Intern"},{"text":"Corporate Compliance Intern"},{"text":"Legal & Compliance Intern"},{"text":"Governance Intern"},{"text":"Regulatory Compliance Intern"}]},{"type":"h","text":"What to learn"},{"type":"p","text":"Try to get exposure to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MCA/ROC filings"},{"text":"Board meeting documentation"},{"text":"Minutes"},{"text":"Resolutions"},{"text":"Statutory registers"},{"text":"Annual filings"},{"text":"Shareholder meetings"},{"text":"Corporate governance"},{"text":"Compliance calendars"},{"text":"Legal research"},{"text":"Regulatory documentation"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and qualifications","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For this career, the CS qua