"},{"text":"Filing preparation"},{"text":"Regulatory-change alerts"},{"text":"Contract analysis"},{"text":"Governance reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The CS professional remains responsible for interpretation, judgement, accuracy and accountability."},{"type":"h","text":"3. ESG Governance"},{"type":"p","text":"Company secretaries will increasingly interact with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ESG reporting"},{"text":"Sustainability disclosures"},{"text":"Board oversight"},{"text":"Climate governance"},{"text":"Stakeholder governance"},{"text":"Sustainability committees"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a useful combination:"},{"type":"flow","items":["CS","Corporate Governance","ESG"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"4. RegTech"},{"type":"p","text":"Regulatory technology will increasingly automate:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Regulation","Obligation","Compliance Task","Evidence","Review","Reporting"]},{"type":"p","text":"Professionals who understand both corporate law and technology will have an advantage."},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the role evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"Traditional:"},{"type":"flow","items":["CS Trainee","Prepare documents","Track filings","Maintain records"]},{"type":"p","text":"Future:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Governance Professional","Interpret regulations","Manage digital compliance","Advise the board","Monitor governance risk","Oversee AI-enabled compliance systems"]},{"type":"p","text":"The profession increasingly combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Corporate Law","Governance","Compliance","Technology","Risk","ESG"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate Law"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Companies Act"},{"text":"Incorporation"},{"text":"Share Capital"},{"text":"Directors"},{"text":"Board Meetings"},{"text":"Shareholder Meetings"},{"text":"Resolutions"},{"text":"Corporate Restructuring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Compliance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M